# Laravel domain

- Thin controllers: authorize → Form Request → Action → API Resource / redirect
- Livewire calls the **same** Actions as `/api/v1`. No second pricing/payment engine
- Prefer Actions (`app/Actions/{Domain}`) and Services (`app/Services/{Domain}`)
- **No** Repository layer by default. Use Eloquent inside Actions/Services
- Form Requests validate input and reject client money authority fields
- Policies/Gates enforce `docs/07-RBAC.md`. Deny by default
- Enums for statuses. Money columns are BIGINT IDR
- Multi-step money/ticket/check-in work uses DB transactions
- Never edit an existing production migration; add a new one
- Do not soft-delete payments, tickets, check-ins, or audit rows
- Prefer Laravel-native packages. Pint when formatting PHP
